    "Claude on your Mac answers in a note under wiki/. It arrives with a later snapshot; Requests shows its progress. Offline, the request waits on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac の Claude が wiki/ のノートで答えます。回答は後のスナップショットで届き、進み具合は「依頼」で見られます。オフラインのあいだ、依頼はこの端末で待ちます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude on your Mac judges the claim against the wiki's sources and writes the verdict as a note under wiki/questions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac の Claude が wiki のソースに照らして主張を判定し、判定を wiki/questions のノートとして書きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude on your Mac orders the notes the vault has on this subject, each after what it builds on, and marks where a bridging source is missing. The path arrives as a note under wiki/paths.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac の Claude が、この主題について vault にあるノートを前提の順に並べ、橋渡しの文献が欠けている箇所を示します。経路は wiki/paths のノートとして届きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
